Short:        ANSI C source code formatter
Author:       mail@dietmar-eilert.de (Dietmar Eilert)
Uploader:     mail dietmar-eilert de (Dietmar Eilert)
Type:         dev/c
Version:      2.2.6 (18/Feb/2001)
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Name:         Indent 2.2.6

This is GNU Indent 2.2.6 compiled for AmigaOS, an ANSI C source code formatter
(not for C++). To recompile the source code with SAS/C, use the provided make
file. To install, copy the indent program somewhere in your path.
